        "original_id": "46150a8c-6d62-582b-9e5e-71cd5301a9ba",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Matheson & Company, Jardine Matheson, Jardine Skinner\n- Places: London, Hong Kong, Calcutta, Bermuda, Singapore, Asia\n- Products/Systems: Singapore Exchange\n- Subsidiaries: Jardine Pacific, Jardine Motors, Jardine Lloyd Thompson, Hongkong Land, Jardine Strategic Holdings, Dairy Farm, Mandarin Oriental Hotel Group, Jardine Cycle & Carriage, Astra International\n\nFacts:\n- Matheson & Company was a London-based trading house closely associated with Jardine Matheson of Hong Kong and Jardine Skinner of Calcutta.\n- Jardine Matheson Holdings Limited, also known as Jardines, is a British conglomerate incorporated in Bermuda.\n- Jardine Matheson Holdings Limited has its primary listing on the Singapore Exchange.\n- Jardine Matheson Holdings Limited has the majority of its business interests in Asia.\n- Jardine Matheson Holdings Limited includes Jardine Pacific, Jardine Motors, Jardine Lloyd Thompson, Hongkong Land, Jardine Strategic Holdings, Dairy Farm, Mandarin Oriental Hotel Group, Jardine Cycle & Carriage, and Astra International as subsidiaries.",
